an></span><span style=\"top:-4.6863em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1863em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为投资支出、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为运维成本、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为年发电量。过去十年光伏组件成本大幅下降使新建光伏的 LCOE 在多数日照条件下低于新建燃煤电厂——这意味着 2021 年 9 月 21 日联大宣示的停建境外煤电，既是环保承诺，也是对商业现实的追认。波士顿大学全球发展政策中心的追踪数据库核验了承诺执行：此后中国官方部门未再新增境外煤电融资。</p>\n<p>绿色合作的增量在清洁能源产业链输出：光伏电站、风电场、电动汽车组装线沿既有走廊布局，&quot;一带一路&quot;绿色投资原则（GIP，2018 年 11 月 30 日于伦敦启动）签署机构数十家，把环境披露要求写入投融资流程。批评者保留的意见集中在两点：存量煤电项目的退役时间表未定；以及部分中资参与的第三方项目存在&quot;洗绿&quot;嫌疑——即以绿色名义包装高碳内容。监督者的持续核查将决定绿色丝路是结构性转型还是叙事升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字与-小而美-新增长点的边界\">数字与&quot;小而美&quot;：新增长点的边界</h2><p>数字丝绸之路承接设施联通的逻辑向比特世界延伸：5G 网络、数据中心、海底光缆、智慧城市构成新基建组合。它的边界同样清晰——美国及其盟友对中国通信设备的安全审查（华为在多国被排除出 5G 建设）划出了地缘政治红线，数据跨境流动规则的国际分歧尚未收敛。数字合作因此呈现&quot;非西方国家快跑、西方市场受限&quot;的不均衡地理，评估时应按国别分组而非整体外推。</p>\n<p>&quot;小而美&quot;是对前十年&quot;求大求全&quot;的直接修正：鲁班工坊式职业培训、菌草技术推广、打井供水、医院学校等中小型民生项目成为优先序列。其经济学逻辑是风险—收益结构的改变：小项目单体回报低但社会接受度高、政治暴露面小、失败成本低——用投资组合的语言说，是从重仓少数巨型头寸转向分散化的民生组合。两个具体样本可作参照：菌草技术（以草代木栽培食药用菌）自 1990 年代起向巴布亚新几内亚等国推广，因单户即可采用而成为最贴近农户的援助形态；鲁班工坊则以&quot;设备+课程标准&quot;整体输出的方式在泰国、吉布提等地培养本地技术工人，直接对接中资项目的用工需求。&quot;小而美&quot;的风险则在于统计困难：数千个小项目的绩效无法像一条铁路那样直观展示，这恰恰考验官方能否放弃以大项目论英雄的汇报惯性。</p>\n<p>对转型期风险与争议的完整证据评估，见<a href=\"challenges-responses\">挑战与应对</a>；新增资金窗口背后的机构分工（政策性银行与丝路基金）已在<a href=\"../implementation-practice/financial-cooperation\">金融合作</a>一篇拆解，此处不再重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-把转型误读为收缩\">反模式：把转型误读为收缩</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收缩误读</td>\n<td>把融资缩量与煤电退出解读为倡议退场</td>\n<td>区分总量扩张结束与存量优化开启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿色贴标</td>\n<td>把一切新能源项目自动计入绿色成就</td>\n<td>用 LCOE 与退役时间表做实质检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机制幻觉</td>\n<td>认为高峰论坛成果清单等于约束性条约</td>\n<td>清单是政治承诺，执行力需逐项追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叙事透支</td>\n<td>把待验证的外交动议当作已完成布局</td>\n<td>标注证据状态，区分承诺与落地</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>意大利退出（2023 年 12 月宣布不再续签）常被引为&quot;收缩论&quot;的证据，但它更准确的读法是政治周期的正常波动：同一时期，150 多个签约国的名单基本稳定，钱凯港（2024 年 11 月开港）等项目仍在交付。判断趋势要看流量与存量的方向是否一致，而不是用单一国家的进出做线性外推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三个拐点构成完整弧线：2018 年定调&quot;工笔画&quot;、2021 年&quot;小而美&quot;加停建煤电双转向、2023 年八项行动完成机制收口</li>\n<li>八项行动的新增资金约 7800 亿元人民币（两家政策银行各 3500 亿窗口加丝路基金 800 亿），缩量而定向，标志存量优化阶段的开始</li>\n<li>光伏 LCOE 的下降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LCOE=\\frac{\\sum (I_t+M_t)/(1+r)^t}{\\sum E_t/(1+r)^t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6143em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8703em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使煤电退出既是环保承诺也是商业现实；波士顿大学数据库核验承诺基本兑现</li>\n<li>&quot;小而美&quot;本质是投资组合从集中巨型头寸转向分散民生组合，其代价是统计与展示难度的上升</li>\n<li>四个反模式的共性是把&quot;方向&quot;当成&quot;结果&quot;——区分承诺、落地与核验三种状态，是阅读一切未来规划文本的基本功</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"未来方向：从大写意到工笔画的路线图","id":"未来方向-从大写意到工笔画的路线图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"八项行动的资金与机制拆解","id":"八项行动的资金与机制拆解"},{"level":2,"text":"绿色转型：煤电退出的承诺与核验","id":"绿色转型-煤电退出的承诺与核验"},{"level":2,"text":"数字与\"小而美\"：新增长点的边界","id":"数字与-小而美-新增长点的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：把转型误读为收缩","id":"反模式-把转型误读为收缩"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"挑战与应对：证据分层下的争议地图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/global-impact/challenges-responses"},"next":null}